# Normalize line endings in the repository, not per machine.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout
# and the Biome formatter rejects every text file it is asked to check, so
# `pnpm lint` fails on files nobody touched. Declaring the endings here makes
# the working tree match what is stored regardless of each machine's config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never let git try to normalize them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
